<s-1 id="RM000000II700DX_01_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___000016G00000">
<ptxt>Inspect Cooler Thermistor (Solar Sensor)</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Voltage Inspection (Dual Mode Automatic Air Conditioner)</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E127185" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<s3>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the voltage between each terminal of the cooler thermistor (solar sensor) connector.</ptxt>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="0.85in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.34in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="0.94in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry morerows="1" valign="middle">
<ptxt>1 - 2</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="left">
<ptxt>Not exposed to direct sunlight (sensor covered with cloth)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Below 0.8V</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="left">
<ptxt>When inspection light is brought close</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>0.8 to 4.3V</ptxt>
<ptxt>(Changes according to light intensity)</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry morerows="1" valign="middle">
<ptxt>1 - 3</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="left">
<ptxt>Not exposed to direct sunlight (sensor covered with cloth)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Below 0.8V</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="left">
<ptxt>When inspection light is brought close</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>0.8 to 4.3V</ptxt>
<ptxt>(Changes according to light intensity)</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<atten3>
<ptxt>The sensor may not respond if the light is weak, so use an incandescent inspection light and bring it to within approximately 30cm of the sensor when measuring.</ptxt>
</atten3>
</s3>
